---
title: Installation
description: Install Design System UI Svelte items with the shadcn-svelte CLI.
order: 2
---

Install any item from **Design System UI Svelte** with the [shadcn-svelte CLI](https://www.shadcn-svelte.com/docs/cli). Pass the item's JSON URL — shadcn-svelte does not resolve namespaced aliases like `@design-system-ui/button`.

Your project must already be set up with [shadcn-svelte](https://www.shadcn-svelte.com/docs/installation). Start with the [`styles`](/utilities/styles) registry item so your project has the design system CSS foundation before adding components. See [Styles](/docs/styles) for what the tokens include.

## Install an item

Replace `button` with the item name from the catalog.

### npm

```sh
npx shadcn-svelte@latest add https://design-system-starter-svelte-docs.vercel.app/r/button.json
```

### pnpm

```sh
pnpm dlx shadcn-svelte@latest add https://design-system-starter-svelte-docs.vercel.app/r/button.json
```

### yarn

```sh
yarn dlx shadcn-svelte@latest add https://design-system-starter-svelte-docs.vercel.app/r/button.json
```

### bun

```sh
bun x shadcn-svelte@latest add https://design-system-starter-svelte-docs.vercel.app/r/button.json
```

Update the URL to your deployed `homepage` from `registry/config.ts`. Each item page shows the same command with that item's name.
